## Context

`tickets/0181-readme-add-binary-download-command-for-f.erg` exists at the
top level as an open ticket, but the same ticket was closed and archived at
`tickets/closed/0181-...erg` (Closed: autoclosed - PR #207).

This causes `erg check` to report a duplicate ID violation, which breaks CI
on the main branch. Discovered while validating PR #214 (ticket 0194).

CI on main has been failing for multiple runs because of this:
  FAIL: default dir passes
  check: 42 passed, 1 failed

## Exit criteria

- [ ] `tickets/0181-readme-add-binary-download-command-for-f.erg` removed from top level
- [ ] `erg check` passes with no duplicate ID errors
- [ ] `make test` passes (specifically `test-check: default dir passes`)
- [ ] CI on main is green
